# Phase-3 self-built failure pack: controlled probes from traps, evals, and
# known ranking bugs. Not hand-labeled production logs — synthetic cases that
# encode expected routing contracts. Consumed by tests/test_quality_routing.py
# and optionally by eval_search.py --route-cases.
#
# Categories:
#   platform-trap     — generic task must not full-route a platform skill
#   platform-explicit — named platform may full/hint-route its skill
#   generic-vs-platform — generic capability should beat mismatched platform
#   policy-lane       — ponytail stays policy; never primary specialist
#   integration-gate  — integration without platform signal is not primary
#   ambiguous-hint    — near-tied specialists stay hint, not full
#   negative          — non-tasks stay none

